202
00:14:10,405 --> 00:14:14,445
Oh, come on. Don't cry!

203
00:14:14,655 --> 00:14:17,585
It's just, Saeko, you...

204
00:14:19,385 --> 00:14:20,785
All right, fine.

205
00:14:20,955 --> 00:14:22,485
I'll stay with you for today.

206
00:14:23,685 --> 00:14:24,825
Really?

207
00:14:25,225 --> 00:14:26,225
Yeah.

208
00:14:27,325 --> 00:14:29,355
