240
00:17:40,585 --> 00:17:41,825
We're done with that, remember?

241
00:17:43,655 --> 00:17:45,625
Didn't we agree to go
back to being friends?

242
00:17:46,255 --> 00:17:49,625
But do we really have to
go back to just being friends?

243
00:17:51,495 --> 00:17:54,935
Because you said you loved me, Saeko.

244
00:18:00,975 --> 00:18:01,975
