245
00:18:03,545 --> 00:18:05,405
I accidentally overheard you yesterday.

246
00:18:06,645 --> 00:18:09,615
Ugh, that's the worst. I
can't believe you heard that...

247
00:18:09,915 --> 00:18:11,084
Hey, Saeko!

248
00:18:11,085 --> 00:18:12,144
Come on, let's go home together!

249
00:18:12,145 --> 00:18:13,414
Please, Saeko!

250
00:18:13,415 --> 00:18:14,455
Stop it.

251
00:18:15,185 --> 00:18:16,885
Why are you still hanging on to this now?

252
00:18:17,325 --> 00:18:19,725
You never even really looked at me.

253
00:18:20,995 --> 00:18:22,354
I did try to understand you!

254
00:18:22,355 --> 00:18:25,294
I've always wanted to know more about you!

255
00:18:25,295 --> 00:18:28,795
Like your past, and what's going
through your head right now.

256
00:18:28,965 --> 00:18:31,135
I've always wanted to know!

257
00:18:32,905 --> 00:18:35,405
You were the one who refused
to open up to me, Saeko!

258
00:19:14,175 --> 00:19:15,175
Wait!

259
00:19:15,345 --> 00:19:16,845
Wait for me, Saeko!

260
00:19:18,085 --> 00:19:19,285
Saeko!

261
00:19:19,985 --> 00:19:20,985
Hold on!

262
00:19:22,285 --> 00:19:23,285
Saeko!

263
00:19:23,385 --> 00:19:27,155
All this time, I thought you were the
one who didn't have feelings for me!

264
00:19:32,525 --> 00:19:33,695
When we started dating,

265
00:19:34,795 --> 00:19:35,965
