280
00:20:30,985 --> 00:20:32,555
I don't even know myself.

281
00:20:36,765 --> 00:20:38,065
Before I knew it,

282
00:20:40,195 --> 00:20:42,765
I had already fallen for you.

283
00:20:47,475 --> 00:20:49,875
Isn't that how falling in love works?

284
00:20:56,915 --> 00:20:57,915
Yeah...

285
00:21:00,355 --> 00:21:01,355
I know.

286
00:21:04,385 --> 00:21:05,425
That's why...

287
00:21:07,855 --> 00:21:10,895
that's how I want someone
to fall in love with me, too.

288
00:21:12,965 --> 00:21:14,095
Trying desperately,

289
00:21:14,665 --> 00:21:15,995
and bending over backward

290
00:21:17,935 --> 00:21:20,835
to force yourself to love
someone is just wrong.

291
00:21:31,115 --> 00:21:32,515
You know that too, right?

292
00:21:36,725 --> 00:21:37,825
Which means...

293
00:21:40,655 --> 00:21:42,825
this can never work between us.

294
00:21:59,815 --> 00:22:01,745
I don't want to understand that at all!

295
00:22:57,005 --> 00:22:58,904
We're the Light Music Club! Check us out!

296
00:22:58,905 --> 00:23:00,104
We're from the Light Music Club.

297
00:23:00,105 --> 00:23:01,305
Here's a flyer for you!

298
00:23:01,975 --> 00:23:03,574
How was your first date?

299
00:23:03,575 --> 00:23:05,105
Did you guys kiss?

300
00:23:05,595 --> 00:23:07,014
We only just started dating.

301
00:23:07,015 --> 00:23:08,455
There's no way we'd kiss right away.

302
00:23:08,695 --> 00:23:11,715
Huh? You kissed me right off
the bat when we started dating.

303
00:23:11,785 --> 00:23:14,015
We're the Light Music Club! Check us out!

304
00:23:14,415 --> 00:23:16,255
We're from the Light Music Club.

305
00:23:20,955 --> 00:23:22,255
Oh, are you okay?

306
00:23:23,225 --> 00:23:25,325
By the way, any interest
in the Light Music Club?

307
00:23:25,365 --> 00:23:26,365
Hey, come on...

308
00:23:26,366 --> 00:23:27,994
What's the harm in asking, right?

309
00:23:27,995 --> 00:23:29,705
At least take a flyer, please?

310
00:23:39,201 --> 00:23:42,735
University Sophmore, Spring.

